---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ctas } from '../lib/marketing';
---
<Layout
  title="Pricing"
  description="Start with a free 30-day trial or request a demo. Bycon TMS pricing is scoped to your NEMT operation after a short conversation."
>
  <article class="prose" style="max-width: 48rem;">
    <span class="mkt-tag">Pricing</span>
    <h1>Pricing</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      We do not publish one-size-fits-all list prices. Medicaid NEMT operations vary by trip volume, markets, broker
      systems, and compliance needs—so we start with a demo or free trial, then scope a package that fits.
    </p>

    <section class="pricing-highlight">
      <h2>Free 30-day trial</h2>
      <p>{ctas.trialNote}</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Automated Ecolane trip sync (current integration)</li>
        <li>Day board and compliance workflows</li>
        <li>Hands-on setup from our team</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="mkt-cta-row" style="margin-top: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
        <a class="mkt-btn mkt-btn-primary" href={ctas.trial.href}>{ctas.trial.label}</a>
        <a class="mkt-btn mkt-btn-secondary" href={ctas.demo.href}>{ctas.demo.label}</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="pricing-grid">
      <section class="pricing-tier">
        <h2>Growth</h2>
        <p>For a single market or region after trial—core TMS, training, and standard support.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="pricing-tier">
        <h2>Scale</h2>
        <p>Higher trip volume, multiple markets, or deeper broker and data integration.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="pricing-tier">
        <h2>Enterprise</h2>
        <p>Large networks with security review, custom terms, and dedicated alignment.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--muted);">{ctas.replySla}</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
